1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,800
In September, a local woman's body was discovered washed up on the riverbank.

2
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,140
Police had originally suspected the death to be a suicide.

3
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:14,800
However, several recent discoveries are beginning to paint this case in a new light.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,440
Authorities now suspect foul play to be involved in her passing.

5
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:23,320
Whatever the truth is, we'd like to encourage our female listeners to stay aware of your surroundings

6
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,800
and mind both your physical and mental health.

7
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:29,640
Yes, we know this situation has many of our listeners wary.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
But we thank you for your continued support

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
and know that together, we will overcome this hardship.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Uh,陆光?

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,560
Uh, who is this?

12
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,200
Huh?

13
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,500
I have no idea.

14
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,600
I was just about to ask you why you have a stalker.

15
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,420
I mean no harm.

16
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,500
Chen Xiao, I'm an architect.

17
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:13,400
I read online about people who can enter photos.

18
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:13,900
Oh!

19
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:15,640
Well, that changes everything!

20
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,660
Sorry he's rude.

21
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,860
So, uh, why were you watching me run?

22
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,720
Because of the rumors.

23
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:24,120
Some say that you're some kind of fairy.

24
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:27,160
Others say you're an old witch.

25
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:28,920
Hold on!

26
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:30,340
Did you say old?

27
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:33,240
I didn't want to get conned, so I figured I'd observe you first.

28
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,340
So would you be willing to help?

29
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:37,340
I'm begging you.

30
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:38,060
Let's restart.

31
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:39,320
Drop the fairy thing.

32
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,540
Call me Xiao Xiao.

33
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,540
Xiao Xiao?

34
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:42,580
No, no, no.

35
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,860
Listen, it's Xiao Xiao.

36
00:01:44,860 --> 00:01:56,360
It didn't take too long to realize

37
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:59,240
Something has changed in the back of my mind

38
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,600
Your eyes

39
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:03,060
There ain't nowhere left to hide behind

40
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:05,360
Time no longer flew like it was

41
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,760
When the flash froze everything before

42
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,400
Without you

43
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,900
I don't know if I could take this road

44
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:14,320
And I'm about to lose my mind

45
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,620
Every minute that I die back in time

46
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:18,920
Every single day exists this rewinds

47
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:21,520
Some physical pain in this eye drive

48
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,160
All night

49
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,420
All the heartaches and the smiles never faded

50
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:27,980
I know you'll be by my side when we make it

51
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:30,640
Come back from the times

52
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,900
Back in time

53
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:37,360
Die back in time

54
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:41,760
Die back in time

55
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:45,980
Die back in time

56
00:02:45,980 --> 00:03:01,820
Huh, isn't this a picture I developed a few days ago?

57
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:04,900
Our witch really keeps us busy.

58
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:06,160
What's the deal?

59
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:08,640
Our client was a benchwarmer on his team

60
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,540
And the school paper's photographer.

61
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,980
I took this picture before the last game

62
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:15,840
It was the most horrible day of my life

63
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,400
I failed a friend

64
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,240
Missed my first love

65
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:21,640
And got in an awful fight with my mom

66
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,620
Now

67
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:25,840
I live with regret

68
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,800
I need them all

69
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,720
To know what went unsaid

70
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,780
Well, what do you think?

71
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:33,540
Is that kind of thing allowed?

72
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:38,980
Hold up

73
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:40,720
Won't this mess up the timeline?

74
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:42,340
That's a no-no

75
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:44,500
Everything will be fine

76
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:46,880
Nothing will be affected

77
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:51,260
If you're sure

78
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:52,360
Let's go

79
00:03:52,360 --> 00:04:04,300
All right

80
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,460
Bring the fire, boys

81
00:04:05,460 --> 00:04:06,480
If we take this one

82
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,160
We'll be off to the county tourney

83
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:08,700
Yeah!

84
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,080
Hey, Chen

85
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,580
Watch the other team closely

86
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:17,100
If any of us gets hurt

87
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:18,180
You're on the court

88
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:19,220
We're counting on you

89
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:21,140
And make sure you stay warmed up

90
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:21,600
Right

91
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,000
You can be called in at any moment

92
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,580
We left out this year

93
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:28,860
I barely even call these guys a team

94
00:04:28,860 --> 00:04:30,800
Just some losers in sad jerseys

95
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,740
Driving all this way was a waste

96
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:33,360
Right?

97
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,380
And what's with this crappy building?

98
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:37,760
It'll crumble any second now

99
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,420
No doubt

100
00:04:38,420 --> 00:04:39,920
That's not such a joke

101
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,300
Lead us to victory!

102
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:43,580
Show these guys

103
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:45,500
Everybody's great to play Long Young

104
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:46,420
The game is the only thing

105
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:49,920
I doubt they'll put up much of a fight

106
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,200
I'm already bored

107
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,440
Can we start?

108
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,820
Hey, listen

109
00:04:54,820 --> 00:04:55,520
Yes

110
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,100
Let's not forget

111
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:58,780
We need good pictures

112
00:04:58,780 --> 00:05:01,380
That way, others might want to join us

113
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:03,340
Sure thing, Captain

114
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:04,660
All over it

115
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:13,420
I can barely see while wearing these dumb glasses

116
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:14,740
I should ditch them

117
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:17,100
You don't even play

118
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,980
Just sit back and relax

119
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,920
Long Young, Long Young

120
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,500
Dominate the ball!

121
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,380
Long Young, Long Young

122
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,880
Win for us all!

123
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:35,660
Woohoo!

124
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:38,000
Don't get down

125
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,440
It's early

126
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,480
Stay strong

127
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:53,660
Can't see anything

128
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:55,040
Don't get to play

129
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,000
This is driving me

130
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:57,640
This is driving me insane

131
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:00,080
Talk to the captain after the game

132
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,180
That'll be one person checked off

133
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:04,320
Try to stay out of trouble until then

134
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,260
Alright, pictures

135
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,460
That'll kill time

136
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:09,940
No flash

137
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:10,780
Turn it off

138
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:12,240
Crap

139
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:20,120
Offensive charging from Long Young

140
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:23,900
Hey, Lou

141
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:25,040
That's not good

142
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,060
That's not good

143
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:25,080
That's not good

144
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,400
Did I change the timeline?

145
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,280
Technically, but it won't last

146
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,980
Just keep at it

147
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:36,020
Things should straighten out

148
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:39,460
That's a relief

149
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:40,680
What?

150
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:44,220
I could barely see because their idiot teammate was using the flash

151
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:45,260
It's not my fault

152
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,680
Blame that guy

153
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,440
I'm sorry, Captain

154
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,640
I wasn't thinking

155
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,780
How's the knee?

156
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,000
Fine

157
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,600
Don't feel bad

158
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,360
He pulled that foul on purpose

159
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,920
Take my place

160
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:03,280
I'll get this knee taken care of while you're out there

161
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:05,180
You're our last hope

162
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:07,020
Do us proud

163
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:09,500
Hey, so, uh

164
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:10,940
Is this part of the plan?

165
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:12,880
Should I play or not?

166
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:15,820
You threw a wrench in things

167
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:18,940
I'm not positive how this game is supposed to play out now

168
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:20,980
But your team must lose

169
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:25,540
Right

170
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:26,920
I'll try my best

171
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:31,040
If this guy's your backup, you might as well call it

172
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,640
Moron

173
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:33,680
We're not done

174
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:36,160
Damn it

175
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:43,100
Defense, now!

176
00:07:56,920 --> 00:08:14,360
No one's better on the court than me

177
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,260
No one

178
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:21,920
New guy

179
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,140
Want to join us?

180
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:24,420
Pass it back

181
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,360
Let's go

182
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:28,940
You look kind of worried

183
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:30,860
Keep an eye on this guy

184
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:31,960
Protect the ball

185
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:34,460
When the heck did he get so good?

186
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,180
Defense!

187
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:35,620
Heard!

188
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:35,880
Right!

189
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:59,520
Dude, you're channeling Kobe out there!

190
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,200
What the hell?

191
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,080
That was awesome!

192
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:01,960
Dang, man

193
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,380
Where'd you learn moves like those?

194
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:04,900
That was amazing

195
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:06,780
He must be practicing in secret

196
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:14,920
With you, we've got a good chance of winning this

197
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:18,500
Right, Cap, consider it done

198
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:19,260
Not so fast

199
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:20,580
They have to lose

200
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:22,560
We can't change the overall result

201
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,980
But you know, it takes an entire team to win

202
00:09:24,980 --> 00:09:26,600
So let's all do our best, yeah?

203
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:31,640
Your mission isn't to show off during a basketball game

204
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:32,960
Reign it in

205
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,180
Yeah, I will

206
00:09:34,180 --> 00:09:40,480
Hey, Captain

207
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,720
Take it easy

208
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,840
Come have a seat

209
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:59,860
Without him, your team's nothing

210
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:02,580
Which is why he still tried to pass to me

211
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:12,900
Oh yeah, the second half is my time to shine

212
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:14,400
How's my acting?

213
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,100
Is it obvious I'm bailing?

214
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:18,460
Hey, so what happened to our new ace's skills?

215
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,280
Guys!

216
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,040
Basketball's a team sport

217
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:25,260
You realize he's been deliberately attracting their attention

218
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:29,560
That created scoring opportunities for the rest of you

219
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,600
Wow, I get it

220
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,140
Come on, let's rally

221
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:34,960
That's right, we're a team

222
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,040
You said it

223
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:51,480
Nice pass

224
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:58,320
Wow, that was a beeline for my hands

225
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,020
Amazing

226
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:01,960
Dude, just keep playing like that and we'll try and keep up with you

227
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,100
Yeah, sure

228
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:05,560
What's going on?

229
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,860
It's just Unlock

230
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:09,180
No way he's that good

231
00:11:09,180 --> 00:11:37,140
What more can I do?

232
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:40,440
Time out from Motor Factory

233
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:47,160
Longyang, Longyang, dominate the bomb!

234
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:50,460
Longyang, Longyang, win it for us all!

235
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,140
I want you to stay here

236
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:54,520
Uh-oh

237
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:56,520
Has he caught on?

238
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:58,600
Your body's shutting down

239
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,920
Too much exertion

240
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:01,420
Take a break

241
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:06,220
The school doc dropped by and wrapped me up

242
00:12:06,220 --> 00:12:07,100
I'm good

243
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,480
Let's take it home

244
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:18,900
Can he really play with that limp?

245
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,620
What if he gets hurt worse?

246
00:12:21,060 --> 00:12:22,400
He should play while he can

247
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:25,860
Because I doubt there'll be any more chances in the future

248
00:12:25,860 --> 00:12:28,580
Our town doesn't have much going for it

249
00:12:28,580 --> 00:12:30,500
School resources are limited

250
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:33,300
This gymnasium used to be a factory

251
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:36,180
The workers built it themselves back in the day

252
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:39,600
When the auto business went busted and closed

253
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,840
Students started using it for games

254
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,800
And the school allowed it

255
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:44,580
But

256
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:47,680
They plan to expand the campus soon

257
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:50,340
If we can show that we're serious and can win

258
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:52,360
Maybe they won't tear down the courts

259
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:55,560
The school's never had a basketball team before

260
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,960
There's no precedent

261
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,980
Then we'll set one

262
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:00,580
You have to let us try

263
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:04,620
In towns like this

264
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:07,820
The only real way to make a better life for yourself

265
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:08,780
Is through studying

266
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:11,980
The basketball dream is just a fairy tale

267
00:13:11,980 --> 00:13:13,200
Nothing more

268
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,400
Nothing less

269
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:17,460
Please coach

270
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:19,080
I need to get back on the court

271
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:21,260
Did you hit your head?

272
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,340
You forget I'm just a chemistry teacher

273
00:13:23,340 --> 00:13:25,380
Your kids need to get yourselves together

274
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:26,400
And be more rational

275
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:29,380
What does basketball mean to you anyway?

276
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,500
It's obvious to see you hold it dear

277
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:34,720
We make a nice game

278
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,660
I think

279
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:37,400
We'll make good partners in the future

280
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,040
You're so serious

281
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,380
It's just a game

282
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:41,320
Nope

283
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,300
You're wrong there

284
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:44,860
See, whenever I pass the ball to you

285
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:47,120
It means that I trust you

286
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:49,700
You get it?

287
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,960
Partnerships like that are a rare thing

288
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:54,200
Don't take them for granted

289
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:14,380
Just remember

290
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:16,280
You exist in the past right now

291
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,580
This isn't your life

292
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:18,860
